{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Seed Messages 完整参数",
    "description": "Seed 系列模型 Messages 接口（Anthropic 兼容格式）的完整 API 参考",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://direct.evolink.ai",
      "description": "生产环境（推荐）"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "备用地址"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/messages": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Seed Messages 接口",
        "description": "- 使用 Anthropic Messages 格式调用 Seed 系列模型，可直接用于 Claude Code 等兼容 Anthropic 协议的工具\n- **无状态接口**：多轮对话每次都要携带完整历史；带思考的 assistant 内容块需原样回传\n- **多模态输入**：支持文本、图片、文档（不支持音频，Lite 的音频输入请使用 Chat Completions 或 Responses 接口）\n- **深度思考**：默认开启，可通过 `thinking` 关闭或用 `output_config.effort` 调节深度\n- **工具调用**：支持函数调用；Seed 2.1 与 `doubao-seed-evolving` 还支持联网搜索（`web_search_20250305`）\n- **结构化输出**：通过 `output_config.format` 输出 JSON Object / JSON Schema\n- **自动缓存**：重复的长前缀自动按缓存命中价计费，无需 `cache_control`，命中量以 `usage.cache_read_input_tokens` 为准\n- **流式输出**：`stream=true` 时按 Anthropic SSE 事件返回：`message_start` → `content_block_start` / `content_block_delta` / `content_block_stop` → `message_delta`（含最终 usage）→ `message_stop`\n- **Seed 2.0 旧模型名**：`doubao-seed-2.0-pro` / `doubao-seed-2.0-lite` 现已重定向到 `doubao-seed-2-1-lite`，`doubao-seed-2.0-code` 现已重定向到 `doubao-seed-evolving`，参数行为以新模型为准；新接入建议直接使用新模型名。`doubao-seed-2.0-mini` 不受影响\n- 快速上手？查看 [快速开始文档](/cn/api-manual/language-series/doubao-seed-2.0/doubao-seed-2.0-messages-quickstart)",
        "operationId": "createMessageSeed",
        "tags": [
          "Messages"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateMessageRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "simple": {
                  "summary": "单轮文本对话",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "请介绍一下你自己"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "system_prompt": {
                  "summary": "使用系统提示词",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "system": "你是一名严谨的中文技术编辑，用简洁的语言回答。",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "解释什么是上下文缓存。"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "multi_turn": {
                  "summary": "多轮对话（每次携带完整历史）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-turbo",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "记住暗号是 RED-583。"
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "assistant",
                        "content": "已记住。"
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "暗号是什么？只回复暗号。"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "streaming": {
                  "summary": "流式输出",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "stream": true,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "写一首关于秋天的四行短诗。"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "thinking_off": {
                  "summary": "关闭深度思考",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-turbo",
                    "max_tokens": 1024,
                    "thinking": {
                      "type": "disabled"
                    },
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "把这句话翻译成英文：今天的会议改到下午三点。"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "effort": {
                  "summary": "调节思考深度",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 8192,
                    "output_config": {
                      "effort": "low"
                    },
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "比较快速排序和归并排序的适用场景。"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "vision": {
                  "summary": "图片理解",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "image",
                            "source": {
                              "type": "url",
                              "url": "https://www.gstatic.com/webp/gallery/1.jpg"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "请描述这张图片中的场景和主要元素。"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "tool_use": {
                  "summary": "函数调用",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "查询北京今天的天气。"
                      }
                    ],
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "name": "get_weather",
                        "description": "查询指定城市的天气",
                        "input_schema": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "city": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "城市名称"
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "city"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "tool_choice": {
                      "type": "auto"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "tool_result": {
                  "summary": "回传函数执行结果",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "name": "get_weather",
                        "description": "查询指定城市的天气",
                        "input_schema": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "city": {
                              "type": "string"
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "city"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "查询北京今天的天气。"
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "assistant",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "thinking",
                            "thinking": "需要调用天气函数……",
                            "signature": "EqQBCkgIARABGAIi..."
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "tool_use",
                            "id": "call_01",
                            "name": "get_weather",
                            "input": {
                              "city": "北京"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "tool_result",
                            "tool_use_id": "call_01",
                            "content": "晴，12~22℃，北风 2 级"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "web_search": {
                  "summary": "联网搜索（仅 Seed 2.1 与 Evolving）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "最近一周有哪些重要的科技新闻？"
                      }
                    ],
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "type": "web_search_20250305",
                        "name": "web_search",
                        "max_uses": 2
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "structured_output": {
                  "summary": "结构化输出（JSON Schema）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "output_config": {
                      "format": {
                        "type": "json_schema",
                        "schema": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "title": {
                              "type": "string"
                            },
                            "tags": {
                              "type": "array",
                              "items": {
                                "type": "string"
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "title",
                            "tags"
                          ],
                          "additionalProperties": false
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "为一篇介绍上下文缓存的文章生成标题和 3 个标签。"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "对话生成成功；流式请求返回 Anthropic SSE 事件流",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageResponse"
                }
              },
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "事件顺序通常为 message_start、content_block_*、message_delta、message_stop。"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 400,
                    "message": "Invalid request parameters",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未认证、Token无效或过期",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 401,
                    "message": "Invalid or expired token",
                    "type": "authentication_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "配额不足、需要充值",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 402,
                    "message": "Insufficient quota",
                    "type": "insufficient_quota_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "https://evolink.ai/dashboard/credits"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "无权限访问",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 403,
                    "message": "Access denied for this model",
                    "type": "permission_error",
                    "param": "model"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "资源不存在",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 404,
                    "message": "Specified model not found",
                    "type": "not_found_error",
                    "param": "model",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "请求频率超限",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 429,
                    "message": "Rate limit exceeded",
                    "type": "rate_limit_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "retry after 60 seconds"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "服务器内部错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 500,
                    "message": "Internal server error",
                    "type": "internal_server_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "try again later"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "模型服务暂时异常",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 502,
                    "message": "Upstream AI service unavailable",
                    "type": "upstream_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "try different model"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "服务暂时不可用",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 503,
                    "message": "Service temporarily unavailable",
                    "type": "service_unavailable_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "retry after 30 seconds"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "CreateMessageRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "max_tokens",
          "messages"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "要调用的模型\n\n| 模型 ID | 定位 | 上下文 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `doubao-seed-2-1-pro` | Seed 2.1 旗舰档，适合复杂推理、长文档与代码库任务（推荐） | 100 万 Token |\n| `doubao-seed-2-1-turbo` | Seed 2.1 低价档，覆盖大多数对话、抽取与 Agent 任务 | 25.6 万 Token |\n| `doubao-seed-2-1-lite` | Seed 2.1 单价最低的一档。音频输入仅限 Chat Completions 和 Responses | 100 万 Token |\n| `doubao-seed-evolving` | 按周更新的 Seed 模型，适合评估新能力 | 100 万 Token |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-pro` | 旧模型名，现已重定向到 `doubao-seed-2-1-lite` | 100 万 Token |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-lite` | 旧模型名，现已重定向到 `doubao-seed-2-1-lite` | 100 万 Token |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-mini` | Seed 2.0 极速版，适合简单任务 | 25.6 万 Token |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-code` | 旧模型名，现已重定向到 `doubao-seed-evolving` | 100 万 Token |\n\n注意两代模型 ID 的写法不同：Seed 2.1 写作 `2-1`（连字符），Seed 2.0 写作 `2.0`（点号）。",
            "enum": [
              "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
              "doubao-seed-2-1-turbo",
              "doubao-seed-2-1-lite",
              "doubao-seed-evolving",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-pro",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-lite",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-mini",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-code"
            ],
            "default": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
            "example": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro"
          },
          "max_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "example": 4096,
            "description": "本次生成允许输出的最大 token 数，包含思考内容与正文。\n\n开启思考时请预留足够预算（建议不低于 1024）；预算耗尽时 `stop_reason` 为 `max_tokens`，可能只有思考内容、没有正文"
          },
          "messages": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "description": "消息列表。多轮对话需携带完整历史，assistant 的 thinking 块需与 signature 一起原样回传",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Message"
            }
          },
          "system": {
            "description": "系统提示词，可为字符串或 text 内容块数组",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TextBlock"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "stream": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "是否以 Anthropic SSE 事件流返回"
          },
          "thinking": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "深度思考开关",
            "required": [
              "type"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "enabled",
                  "disabled"
                ],
                "description": "思考模式\n\n- `enabled`: 开启思考，模型先思考再回答（默认）\n- `disabled`: 关闭思考，模型直接回答\n\n所有 Seed 模型默认开启思考，思考 token 计入输出用量并按输出计费。"
              }
            }
          },
          "output_config": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "输出配置：思考深度与结构化输出",
            "properties": {
              "effort": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "none",
                  "minimal",
                  "low",
                  "medium",
                  "high",
                  "xhigh",
                  "max"
                ],
                "description": "思考深度\n\n- `minimal`: 关闭思考，直接回答\n- `low`: 轻量思考，侧重快速响应\n- `medium`: 均衡模式，兼顾速度与深度\n- `high`: 深度分析，处理复杂问题\n\n**默认值**：Seed 2.1 与 `doubao-seed-evolving` 为 `high`；Seed 2.0 为 `medium`。\n\n**兼容取值**：`none` 按 `minimal` 处理；`xhigh`、`max` 按 `high` 处理。"
              },
              "format": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "结构化输出格式",
                "required": [
                  "type"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "json_object",
                      "json_schema"
                    ],
                    "description": "- `json_object`: 返回 JSON 对象，请在提示词中明确要求输出 JSON\n- `json_schema`: 按 `schema` 约束返回 JSON"
                  },
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": true,
                    "description": "JSON Schema 定义（type 为 json_schema 时必填）"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "temperature": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 2,
            "description": "采样温度，取值范围 [0, 2]。建议仅调整 temperature 或 top_p 其中之一"
          },
          "top_p": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 1,
            "description": "核采样概率阈值，取值范围 [0, 1]"
          },
          "stop_sequences": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "maxItems": 4,
            "description": "停止序列，模型生成到这些字符串时停止，字符串本身不会输出。最多 4 个。\n\n开启思考时不支持此参数，需要时请先关闭思考"
          },
          "tools": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "工具列表\n\n- 自定义函数：`name` + `description` + `input_schema`，所有 Seed 模型支持\n- 联网搜索：`type=web_search_20250305`、`name=web_search`，仅 Seed 2.1 与 `doubao-seed-evolving` 支持；Seed 2.0 声明联网搜索会返回 400\n\n不支持网页抓取（`web_fetch`）等其它服务端工具，传入会返回 400。联网搜索按实际搜索次数计费，以模型定价为准",
            "items": {
              "oneOf": [
                {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Tool"
                },
                {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebSearchTool"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "tool_choice": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolChoice"
          }
        }
      },
      "Message": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "role",
          "content"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "user",
              "assistant"
            ],
            "description": "消息角色。系统提示词请使用顶层 `system`"
          },
          "content": {
            "description": "消息内容，可以是纯文本字符串或内容块数组",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContentBlock"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "ContentBlock": {
        "description": "内容块：文本、图片、文档、思考、函数调用、函数结果，以及联网搜索的调用与结果（多轮对话回传用）",
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TextBlock"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ImageBlock"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DocumentBlock"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ThinkingBlock"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolUseBlock"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolResultBlock"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ServerToolUseBlock"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebSearchResultBlock"
          }
        ]
      },
      "TextBlock": {
        "type": "object",
        "title": "文本",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "text"
        ],
